{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Devils is a fast-paced multiplayer party game for 1-4 players. Race, jump, and climb through crazy obstacle courses, using wild power-ups like bees and magnets to mess with your rivals. Grab the crown and race to the finish line\u2014the first one there wins, but chaos is guaranteed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Races with Hilarious Twists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/a6400c1f82ffd68b93b2a7301fc169e8.poster.avif?t=1764074859\" width=698 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/a6400c1f82ffd68b93b2a7301fc169e8.webm?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/a6400c1f82ffd68b93b2a7301fc169e8.mp4?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Power-Ups to Outsmart Your Opponents :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bee Strike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Release a  bee that chases down players, forcing them to drop the crown when hit</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/98d80cf4a11b6e13881768923677e801.poster.avif?t=1764074859\" width=640 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/98d80cf4a11b6e13881768923677e801.webm?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/98d80cf4a11b6e13881768923677e801.mp4?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnet Madness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Snatch the crown or nearby items from rivals with a powerful magnetic pull.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/33881a8e8606cde90edd196249682259.poster.avif?t=1764074859\" width=698 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/33881a8e8606cde90edd196249682259.webm?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/33881a8e8606cde90edd196249682259.mp4?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peg-Top Flip</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Launch a spinning peg-top that bounces around the map, flipping your opponents' controls on impact.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/55e8678538b05f58b6871550dcc44e50.poster.avif?t=1764074859\" width=698 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/55e8678538b05f58b6871550dcc44e50.webm?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/55e8678538b05f58b6871550dcc44e50.mp4?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Troll or Be Trolled</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Tiny Devils</strong>, anything goes. Troll your friends by knocking them off course, stealing their power-ups, or blocking their path with a perfectly timed smoke bomb. But be warned\u2014they can do the same to you. It\u2019s all part of the game in this chaotic free-for-all! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Will Wear the Crown?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the cleverest, quickest, and most cunning player will win. Will you be the one to outsmart your friends, navigate the madness, and claim victory? Join the fun in <strong>Tiny Devils</strong> and see if you have what it takes to wear the crown!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"first","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3202430/ec9553e50d742936d43c7952cd7a1ffe4fc4c7d0.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3202430?t=1764074859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764074859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/c7bd40c8b0730cf74ee37cc265a00bfce616ddc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764074859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/c7bd40c8b0730cf74ee37cc265a00bfce616ddc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764074859","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Devils is a fast-paced multiplayer party game for 1-4 players. Race, jump, and climb through crazy obstacle courses, using wild power-ups like bees and magnets to mess with your rivals. Grab the crown and race to the finish line\u2014the first one there wins, but chaos is guaranteed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Races with Hilarious Twists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/a6400c1f82ffd68b93b2a7301fc169e8.poster.avif?t=1764074859\" width=698 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/a6400c1f82ffd68b93b2a7301fc169e8.webm?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/a6400c1f82ffd68b93b2a7301fc169e8.mp4?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Power-Ups to Outsmart Your Opponents :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bee Strike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Release a  bee that chases down players, forcing them to drop the crown when hit</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/98d80cf4a11b6e13881768923677e801.poster.avif?t=1764074859\" width=640 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/98d80cf4a11b6e13881768923677e801.webm?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/98d80cf4a11b6e13881768923677e801.mp4?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnet Madness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Snatch the crown or nearby items from rivals with a powerful magnetic pull.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/33881a8e8606cde90edd196249682259.poster.avif?t=1764074859\" width=698 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/33881a8e8606cde90edd196249682259.webm?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/33881a8e8606cde90edd196249682259.mp4?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peg-Top Flip</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Launch a spinning peg-top that bounces around the map, flipping your opponents' controls on impact.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/55e8678538b05f58b6871550dcc44e50.poster.avif?t=1764074859\" width=698 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/55e8678538b05f58b6871550dcc44e50.webm?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/extras/55e8678538b05f58b6871550dcc44e50.mp4?t=1764074859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Troll or Be Trolled</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Tiny Devils</strong>, anything goes. Troll your friends by knocking them off course, stealing their power-ups, or blocking their path with a perfectly timed smoke bomb. But be warned\u2014they can do the same to you. It\u2019s all part of the game in this chaotic free-for-all! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Will Wear the Crown?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the cleverest, quickest, and most cunning player will win. Will you be the one to outsmart your friends, navigate the madness, and claim victory? Join the fun in <strong>Tiny Devils</strong> and see if you have what it takes to wear the crown!</p>","developers":["ENIGMA STUDIO Sarl"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202430/header.jpg?t=1764074859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3202430/779352/3bb4c646f830f6d941cac4fcc8a7de9b8e66bf8a/1750880454/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740485522","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3202430/779352/3bb4c646f830f6d941cac4fcc8a7de9b8e66bf8a/1750880454/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740485522","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3202430/779352/3bb4c646f830f6d941cac4fcc8a7de9b8e66bf8a/1750880454/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740485522","id":257069678,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257069678/592cd03b3f536b85bb32a7c5db25ffc76ef164dd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740485522"}],"name":"Tiny Devils","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Tiny Devils - $4.99 USD","packageid":1135644,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499}],"title":"Buy Tiny Devils"}],"packages":[1135644],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stron